{"5133510": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Fire Up Together", "steam_appid": 5133510, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Embark on the Fire Up Together Adventure With Your Friends!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set out from the fire station, connect your hoses to hydrants, and carry your water supply as high as possible. Extinguish the fires in your path, overcome challenging obstacles, and climb as high as you can with your friends!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play Solo or With Friends</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on this crazy adventure alone or form a team of up to four players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5133510/extras/b5c4b771151293aaba710728997df5c5.poster.avif?t=1788203734\" width=720 height=372 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5133510/extras/b5c4b771151293aaba710728997df5c5.webm?t=1788203734\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5133510/extras/b5c4b771151293aaba710728997df5c5.mp4?t=1788203734\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Master Physics-Based Hose Mechanics</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your hose is powered by a physics simulation: it wraps around platforms, stretches, and swings. Swing from wherever it gets caught to keep moving, or let a teammate grab onto your hose and climb up. But be careful—a tangled hose will eventually become your problem too.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5133510/extras/fe8cc564875a9b9d524d88ee6fc7b4ea.poster.avif?t=1788203734\" width=768 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5133510/extras/fe8cc564875a9b9d524d88ee6fc7b4ea.webm?t=1788203734\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5133510/extras/fe8cc564875a9b9d524d88ee6fc7b4ea.mp4?t=1788203734\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Rise With the Power of Water</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The pressurized water blasting from your fire hose isn’t just for putting out fires. Use its recoil to launch yourself into the air, reach platforms, and climb higher.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Of course, you can also turn your hose on your friends. Teach troublesome teammates a little lesson and enjoy sending them tumbling back down!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5133510/extras/dac11828613c9934ed29e43aa80d94ff.poster.avif?t=1788203734\" width=768 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5133510/extras/dac11828613c9934ed29e43aa80d94ff.webm?t=1788203734\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5133510/extras/dac11828613c9934ed29e43aa80d94ff.mp4?t=1788203734\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Firefighters’ New Favorite Sport: HoseBall</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How about playing a little HoseBall at the fire station before setting off on your adventure?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game, you don’t kick the ball—you blast it with pressurized water! Control your hose, line up long-range shots, and send the ball into the goal before your friends do.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5133510/extras/024a5e865c7fb1424be430d8777e7d11.poster.avif?t=1788203734\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5133510/extras/024a5e865c7fb1424be430d8777e7d11.webm?t=1788203734\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5133510/extras/024a5e865c7fb1424be430d8777e7d11.mp4?t=1788203734\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Embark on the Fire Up Together Adventure With Your Friends!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set out from the fire station, connect your hoses to hydrants, and carry your water supply as high as possible. Extinguish the fires in your path, overcome challenging obstacles, and climb as high as you can with your friends!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play Solo or With Friends</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on this crazy adventure alone or form a team of up to four players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5133510/extras/b5c4b771151293aaba710728997df5c5.poster.avif?t=1788203734\" width=720 height=372 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5133510/extras/b5c4b771151293aaba710728997df5c5.webm?t=1788203734\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5133510/extras/b5c4b771151293aaba710728997df5c5.mp4?t=1788203734\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Master Physics-Based Hose Mechanics</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your hose is powered by a physics simulation: it wraps around platforms, stretches, and swings. Swing from wherever it gets caught to keep moving, or let a teammate grab onto your hose and climb up. But be careful—a tangled hose will eventually become your problem too.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5133510/extras/fe8cc564875a9b9d524d88ee6fc7b4ea.poster.avif?t=1788203734\" width=768 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5133510/extras/fe8cc564875a9b9d524d88ee6fc7b4ea.webm?t=1788203734\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5133510/extras/fe8cc564875a9b9d524d88ee6fc7b4ea.mp4?t=1788203734\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Rise With the Power of Water</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The pressurized water blasting from your fire hose isn’t just for putting out fires. Use its recoil to launch yourself into the air, reach platforms, and climb higher.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Of course, you can also turn your hose on your friends. Teach troublesome teammates a little lesson and enjoy sending them tumbling back down!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5133510/extras/dac11828613c9934ed29e43aa80d94ff.poster.avif?t=1788203734\" width=768 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5133510/extras/dac11828613c9934ed29e43aa80d94ff.webm?t=1788203734\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5133510/extras/dac11828613c9934ed29e43aa80d94ff.mp4?t=1788203734\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Firefighters’ New Favorite Sport: HoseBall</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How about playing a little HoseBall at the fire station before setting off on your adventure?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game, you don’t kick the ball—you blast it with pressurized water! Control your hose, line up long-range shots, and send the ball into the goal before your friends do.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5133510/extras/024a5e865c7fb1424be430d8777e7d11.poster.avif?t=1788203734\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5133510/extras/024a5e865c7fb1424be430d8777e7d11.webm?t=1788203734\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5133510/extras/024a5e865c7fb1424be430d8777e7d11.mp4?t=1788203734\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "In this adventure for up to four players, water is your only weapon. Blast yourself into the air with the recoil of pressurized water, extinguish fires, and climb higher and higher.", "supported_languages": "English, Turkish", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5133510/5e50d93cdce09a451966f68bddf440abb746aa08/header.jpg?t=1788203734", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5133510/539084befe1cef8f4ac990cd4d33e785c6bd2d7a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788203734", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5133510/539084befe1cef8f4ac990cd4d33e785c6bd2d7a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1788203734", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-6100 or AMD FX-6300<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 750</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Eloy Games"], "publishers": ["Eloy Games"], "package_groups": 